    "media:imagetext": "— aIr nEw ZEaLanD\nFor your Safety-Please Read\nPlease do not remove this folder from the aircraft\nExperienced passengers review the safety instructions\nbefore take-off and landing\nFor your safety, know how to move out of this airplane - fast.\n(There is fire danger anytime a landing is other than normal)\nFamiliarise yourself with your exit locations.\nKnow how to jump into the escape slide.\nKnow how to put on your lifejacket quickly.\nKnow where the nearest liferaft is positioned.\nB747\nINTERNATIONEE\nFasten\nFold up\nTray\nStow\nluggage\nunder\nseat\nUnfasten\nTake-off/Landing\nNo Smoking\nFor safety, keep seat\nbelts comfortably\nfastened at all times\nSeat Belts\nBrace Position\nDon't use in flight",
